    (22,29,'proverbs',3,34,1,E'*he scorneth the scorners: but he giveth grace unto the lowly* (Proverbs 3:34) — the Tanakh root of *he shall save the humble person* (22:29), the verse the apostles quote.'),
    (22,29,'james',4,6,2,E'*Elohim (God) resisteth the proud, but giveth grace unto the humble* (James 4:6) — James lifts the humble-saving of 22:29 forward as the settled rule.'),
